    {
      "id": "dongzhi-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳黄经等分黄道24段。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the ecliptic equally."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dongzhi-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "冬至是二十四节气中的第二十二个：太阳到达黄经270°，北半球白昼最短。",
        "en": "Dongzhi is the twenty-second term: the Sun reaches 270°, shortest day in the Northern Hemisphere."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-dongzhi-feature",
        "source-xinhua-dongzhi-2021"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-dongzhi-longitude-270"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dongzhi-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "冬至是农历十一月的\"中气\"，传统历法以冬至所在月定十一月，是置闰的锚点。",
        "en": "Dongzhi anchors the eleventh lunar month, serving as the leap-month reference point."
      },
      "region": [
        "北半球（极值命题为半球级表述）；\"1月最冷\"经验来自中国（除少数海岛和海滨局部地区外）"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文口径；2021年新华社稿含当年交节实例与专家口径",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-xinhua-dongzhi-2021",
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-dongzhi-shortest-day-year-anchor"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dongzhi-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "冬至日后白昼渐长：\"冬至阳生\"，古人视为阳气回转。",
        "en": "Days lengthen after Dongzhi: ancients saw the return of yang energy."
      },
      "region": [
        "北半球（极值命题为半球级表述）；\"1月最冷\"经验来自中国（除少数海岛和海滨局部地区外）"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文口径；2021年新华社稿含当年交节实例与专家口径",
      "source_ids": [
