      "id": "dongzhi-c7",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "冬至是\"至暗时刻\"也是\"光明回归\"——阴极阳生的哲学。清代北京民间\"不为节，惟食餛飩\"。",
        "en": "Dongzhi is both darkest moment and return of light — the philosophy of yang reborn from extreme yin."
      },
